\rtlch\fcs1 \af37\afs26\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f37\fs26\lang3081\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3081\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 1/ Ngu\u7891\'3fn thu c\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\'ed \'d0\u7843\'3fm b
\u7843\'3fo h\'e0ng h\u7843\'3fi  (\'d0BHH) l\'e0 kho\u7843\'3fn thu c\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi ph\'fd\'f5ng ti\u7879\'3fn thu\u7927\'3f trong v\'e0 ngo\'e0i n\'fd\u7899\'3fc khi ra, v\'e0o c\'e1
c c\u7843\'3fng bi\u7875\'3fn Vi\u7879\'3ft Nam, nh\u7857\'3fm m\u7909\'3fc \'f0\'edch s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng 1 ph\u7847\'3fn \'f0\u7875\'3f trang tr\u7843\'3fi chi ph\'ed cho c\'f4ng t\'e1c n\u7841\'3fo v\'e9t, duy tu s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa lu
\u7891\'3fng ra v\'e0o c\'e1c c\u7843\'3fng bi\u7875\'3fn, ch\u7881\'3fnh tr\u7883\'3f lu\u7891\'3fng, thanh th\u7843\'3fi ch\'fd\u7899\'3fng ng\u7841\'3fi v\u7853\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 
t, duy tr\'ec ho}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 \u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng c\u7911\'3fa h\u7879\'3f th\u7889\'3fng b\'e1o hi\u7879\'3fu h\'e0ng h\u7843\'3fi.
\par 2/ B\u7843\'3fo \'f0\u7843\'3fm an to\'e0n h\'e0ng h\u7843\'3fi Vi\u7879\'3ft Nam, ( vi\u7871\'3ft t\u7855\'3ft l\'e0 B\'d0ATHHVN) l\'e0 t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc s\u7921\'3f nghi\u7879\'3fp kinh t\u7871\'3f th\u7889\'3fng nh\u7845\'3ft trong ph\u7841\'3f
m vi c\u7843\'3f n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ch\u7883\'3fu tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm b\u7843\'3fo \'f0\u7843\'3fm an to\'e0n giao th\'f4ng \'f0\'fd\u7901\'3fng bi\u7875\'3fn tr\'ean v\'f9ng bi\u7875\'3fn, th\u7873\'3fm l\u7909\'3fc \'f0\u7883\'3fa v\'f9ng \'f0\u7863
\'3fc quy\u7873\'3fn kinh t\u7871\'3f c\u7911\'3fa C\u7897\'3fng ho\'e0 XHCN Vi\u7879\'3ft Nam, \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc thu c\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\'ed \'d0BHH th\'f4ng qua h\u7879\'3f th\u7889\'3fng c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f C\u7843
\'3fng v\u7909\'3f. Ngu\u7891\'3fn thu c\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\'ed \'d0BHH t\u7841\'3fi c\'e1c C\u7843\'3fng v\u7909\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp v\'e0o NSNN theo t\u7927\'3f l\u7879\'3f quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh, ph\u7847\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 n c\'f2n l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 \u7841\'3fi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc chuy\u7875\'3fn v\u7873\'3f t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa c
\'f5 quan \'d0BATHH Vi\u7879\'3ft Nam m\u7903\'3f t\u7841\'3fi Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc (\'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc g\u7885\'3fi l\'e0 ngu\u7891\'3fn thu c\u7911\'3fa  B\'d0ATHHVN).
\par 3/ H\'e0ng n\'e3m, c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch thu c\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\'ed \'d0BHH, k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch chi cho c\'f4ng t\'e1c B\'d0ATHHVN \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 \'e3 }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh v\'e0 B\u7897\'3f GTVT th\u7889\'3fng nh\u7845\'3ft b\u7857\'3fng v
\'e3n b\u7843\'3fn, C\u7909\'3fc h\'e0ng h\u7843\'3fi Vi\u7879\'3ft Nam s\u7869\'3f ti\u7871\'3fn h\'e0nh giao k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch thu c\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\'ed \'d0BHH cho c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f C\u7843\'3fng v\u7909\'3f v\'e0 k\u7871\'3f ho
\u7841\'3fch  chi cho c\'f5 quan B\'d0ATHH Vi\u7879\'3ft Nam.
\par K\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch chi c\u7911\'3fa B\'d0ATHHVN h\'e0ng n\'e3m \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc s\u7855\'3fp x\u7871\'3fp trong ph\u7841\'3fm vi k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch ngu\u7891\'3fn thu v\u7873\'3f c\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\'ed \'d0BHH do c\'e1c c\u7843\'3fng v
\u7909\'3f chuy\u7875\'3fn v\u7873\'3f c\'f5 quan B\'d0ATHHVN.Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch ngu\u7891\'3fn thu n\'e0y sau khi \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 \'e3 }{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 \'f0\u7843\'3fm b\u7843\'3fo \'f0\u7911\'3f theo k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch chi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc duy\u7879\'3ft v\u7851\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
