\rtlch\fcs1 \af37\afs26\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f37\fs26\lang3081\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3081\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 1/ C\'f4ng t\'e1c l\u7853\'3fp k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch
\par a/ K\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch thu c\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\'ed \'d0BHH : H\'e0ng n\'e3m, c\'f9ng v\u7899\'3fi vi\u7879\'3fc l\u7853\'3fp k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch thu ph\'ed c\u7843\'3fng v\u7909\'3f, c\'e1c c\'f5 quan c\u7843\'3fng v\u7909\'3f ti\u7871\'3f
n h\'e0nh l\u7853\'3fp k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch thu v\u7873\'3f c\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\'ed \'d0BHH \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi ph\'fd\'f5ng ti\u7879\'3fn thu\u7927\'3f ra, v\'e0o c\'e1c c\u7843\'3fng bi\u7875\'3fn trong v\'f9ng n\'fd
\u7899\'3fc do C\u7843\'3fng v\u7909\'3f qu\u7843\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 n l\'fd, v\'e0 g}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 \u7917\'3fi k
\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch thu v\u7873\'3f C\u7909\'3fc h\'e0ng h\u7843\'3fi Vi\u7879\'3ft Nam, \'f0\u7891\'3fng th\u7901\'3fi g\u7917\'3fi cho c\'f5 quan B\'d0ATHHVN theo d}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 \'f5i.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 b/ K\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch chi B\'d0ATHH
\par C\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o y\'eau c\u7847\'3fu nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f c\u7911\'3fa c\'f4ng t\'e1c B\'d0ATHH, h\'e0ng n\'e3n c\'f5 quan B\'d0ATHHVN ti\u7871\'3fn h\'e0nh l\u7853\'3fp k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch chi g\u7917\'3fi v\u7873\'3f C\u7909\'3fc h
\'e0ng h\u7843\'3fi Vi\u7879\'3ft Nam. N\u7897\'3fi dung k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch chi g\u7891\'3fm :
\par - Chi th\'fd\u7901\'3fng xuy\'ean :
\par + L\'fd\'f5ng v\'e0 ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp l\'fd\'f5ng
\par + B\u7843\'3fo hi\u7875\'3fm XH, B\u7843\'3fo hi\u7875\'3fm y t\u7871\'3f
\par + S\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa th\'fd\u7901\'3fng xuy\'ean c\'e1c ph\'fd\'f5ng ti\u7879\'3fn, thi\u7871\'3ft b\u7883\'3f
\par + C\'f4ng t\'e1c ph\'ed
\par + H\u7897\'3fi ngh\u7883\'3f l\u7877\'3f t\'e2n kh\'e1nh ti\u7871\'3ft
\par + C\'f4ng v\u7909\'3f ph\'ed
\par + Ngi\u7879\'3fp v\u7909\'3f ph\'ed g\u7891\'3fm : \'d0\u7843\'3fm b\u7843\'3fo \'e1nh s\'e1ng, kh\u7843\'3fo s\'e1t lu\u7891\'3fng ra th\'f4ng b\'e1o h\'e0ng h\u7843\'3fi, thay th\u7843\'3f \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ch\u7881\'3fnh gao, ti\u7871\'3fp t\u7871\'3f
 cho cho c\'e1c \'f0\'e8n \'f0\u7843\'3fo v\'e0 chi ph\'ed kh\'e1c.
\par - Chi kh\'f4ng th\'fd\u7901\'3fng xuy\'ean :
\par +Thanh th\u7843\'3fi ch\'fd\u7899\'3fng ng\u7841\'3fi v\u7853\'3ft, ch\u7881\'3fnh tr\u7883\'3f lu\u7891\'3fng
\par + N\u7841\'3fo v\'e9t duy tu v\'e0 s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn lu\u7891\'3fng ra v\'e0o c\u7843\'3fng
\par + S\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn T\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh
\par c/ H\'e0ng n\'e3m, c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o c\'e1c b\'e1o c\'e1o k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch thu \'d0BHH, k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch chi \'d0BATHH c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f, C\u7909\'3fc h\'e0ng h\u7843\'3fi Vi\u7879\'3ft Nam c\'f3 tr\'e1
ch nhi\u7879\'3fm ti\u7871\'3fn h\'e0nh ki\u7875\'3fm tra, r\'e0 so\'e1t, ch\u7881\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 nh l\'fd v\'e0 t}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 \u7893\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp g\u7917\'3fi b\'e1o c\'e1o k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch v\u7873\'3f B\u7897\'3f giao th\'f4ng v\u7853\'3fn t\u7843\'3fi , B\u7897\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383  T\'e0i ch\'ednh. Sau khi c\'f3 \'fd ki}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 \u7871\'3fn th\u7889\'3fng nh\u7845\'3ft b\u7857\'3fng v\'e3n b\u7843\'3fn c\u7911
\'3fa B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh v\'e0 B\u7897\'3f Giao th\'f4ng v\u7853\'3fn t\u7843\'3fi v\u7873\'3f k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch ngu\u7891\'3fn thu c\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\'ed \'d0BHH, k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch chi B\'d0ATHH v\'e0 k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3f
ch n\u7897\'3fp NSNN, C\u7909\'3fc h\'e0ng h\u7843\'3fi Vi\u7879\'3ft Nam ti\u7871\'3fn h\'e0nh giao k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch thu, chi thu n\u7897\'3fp NSNN ch\'ednh th\u7913\'3fc cho c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f.
\par 2/ T\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc thu c\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\'ed \'d0BHH :
\par - C\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f C\u7843\'3fng v\u7909\'3f c\'f3 nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp thu c\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\'ed \'d0BHH theo k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch giao c\u7911\'3fa C\u7909\'3fc h\'e0ng h\u7843\'3fi Vi\u7879\'3f
t Nam.
\par  - C\'e1c c\u7843\'3fng v\u7909\'3f c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm n\u7897\'3fp v\'e0o NSNN s\u7889\'3f thu v\u7873\'3f c\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\'ed \'d0BHH theo t\u7927\'3f l\u7879\'3f v\'e0 nh\u7919\'3fng quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi \'f0i\u7875\'3fm 4 d
\'fd\u7899\'3fi \'f0\'e2y v\'e0 chuy\u7875\'3fn k\u7883\'3fp th\u7901\'3fi s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 n thu c\'f2n l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 \u7841\'3fi v\u7873\'3f t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa c\'f5 quan B\'d0ATHH Vi\u7879\'3ft Nam.
\par - M\u7889\'3fi quan h\u7879\'3f ph\u7889\'3fi h\u7907\'3fp gi\u7919\'3fa c\'f5 quan B\'d0ATHH Vi\u7879\'3ft Nam v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c c\'f5 quan C\u7843\'3fng v\u7909\'3f do C\u7909\'3fc h\'e0ng h\u7843\'3fi Vi\u7879\'3ft Nam quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh v\'e0  tr
\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp \'f0\'f4n \'f0\u7889\'3fc gi\'e1m s\'e1t ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f, \'f0\u7875\'3f \'f0\u7843\'3fm b\u7843\'3fo t\u7853\'3fp trung thu \'f0\'fang, thu \'f0\u7911\'3f ngu\u7891\'3f
n thu c\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\'ed \'d0BHH.
\par - \'d0\u7875\'3f khuy\u7871\'3fn kh\'edch c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp thu,  cho ph\'e9p c\'e1c C\u7843\'3fng v\u7909\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc tr\'edch 0,5% tr\'ean t\u7893\'3fng s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn thu c\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph
\'ed \'d0BHH th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7875\'3f chi ph\'ed cho c\'f4ng t\'e1c thu v\'e0 tr\'edch th\'fd\u7903\'3fng cho nh\u7919\'3fng ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp tham gia c\'f4ng t\'e1c thu, s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn n\'e0y \'f0
\'fd\u7907\'3fc gi\u7843\'3fm tr\u7915\'3f v\'e0o s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn chuy\u7875\'3fn v\u7873\'3f cho c\'f5 quan B\'d0ATHH Vi\u7879\'3ft Nam.
\par 3/ Qu\u7843\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 n l\'fd chi :
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 - C\'f5 quan B\'d0ATHH Vi\u7879\'3ft Nam v\'e0 c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f th\'e0nh vi\'ean \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc m\u7903\'3f t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn t\u7841\'3fi Kho b
\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc, n\'f5i c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f \'f0\u7863\'3ft tr\u7909\'3f s\u7903\'3f v\'e0 c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm ch\u7845\'3fp h\'e0nh nghi\'eam ch\u7881\'3fnh c\'e1c quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa Kho b\u7841\'3f
c Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\u7873\'3f vi\u7879\'3fc m\u7903\'3f v\'e0 s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn, s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng ngu\u7891\'3fn kinh ph\'ed.
\par - Vi\u7879\'3fc chi ti\'eau c\u7911\'3fa c\'f5 quan B\'d0ATHH Vi\u7879\'3ft Nam \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn theo nguy\'ean t\u7855\'3fc sau :
\par + C\'f5 quan B\'d0ATHH Vi\u7879\'3ft Nam th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn vi\u7879\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f39\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 c \'f0\'e3ng k\'fd k}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 \u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch chi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc duy\u7879\'3ft v\u7899\'3fi c\'f5 quan Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0 thanh to\'e1n kinh ph\'ed cho ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng B\'d0ATHH 
th\'f4ng qua h\u7879\'3f th\u7889\'3fng Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc.
\par + \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi m\u7909\'3fc chi th\'fd\u7901\'3fng xuy\'ean B\'d0ATHH
\par C\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch chi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc C\u7909\'3fc HHVN ph\'ea duy\u7879\'3ft, c\'f5 quan B\'d0ATHH Vi\u7879\'3ft Nam th\'f4ng b\'e1o cho Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch chi c
\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f th\'e0nh vi\'ean theo t\u7915\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 ng th\'e1ng, qu\'fd. Tr\'ean c}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 \'f5 s\u7903\'3f \'f0\'f3 Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn vi\u7879\'3fc c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t kinh ph\'ed cho c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f th\'e0nh vi\'ean v\'e0 c\'f5
 quan B\'d0ATHH t\u7915\'3f ngu\u7891\'3fn thu c\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\'ed \'d0BHH c\u7911\'3fa c\'f5 quan B\'d0ATHH Vi\u7879\'3ft Nam.
\par + \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi m\u7909\'3fc chi kh\'f4ng th\'fd\u7901\'3fng xuy\'ean :
