i l\u7853\'3fp v\'e0 g\u7917\'3fi b\'e1o c\'e1o quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n v\u7873\'3f C\u7909\'3fc H\'e0ng h\u7843\'3fi Vi\u7879\'3ft nam B\u7897\'3f GTVT v\'e0 B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh .
\par N\u7897\'3fi dung v\'e0 c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f l\u7853\'3fp b\'e1o c\'e1o quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n g\u7891\'3fm:
\par a. Quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n ngu\u7891\'3fn thu c\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\'ed \'d0BHH.
\par - C\'f5 quan B\'d0ATHH Vi\u7879\'3ft nam ph\u7889\'3fi h\u7907\'3fp v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f c\u7843\'3fng v\u7909\'3f r\'e0 so\'e1t, \'f0\u7889\'3fi chi\u7871\'3fu, ngu\u7891\'3fn thu c\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\'ed \'d0BHH, x\'e1c \'f0\u7883
\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f thu c\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\'ed \'d0BHH, s\u7889\'3f chuy\u7875\'3fn t\u7915\'3f c\'e1c C\u7843\'3fng v\u7909\'3f v\u7873\'3f c\'f5 quan B\'d0ATHH Vi\u7879\'3ft nam , s\u7889\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp v\'e0 s\u7889\'3f \'f0}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 \'e3 n}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 \u7897\'3fp v\'e0o NSNN v\u7873\'3f c\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\'ed \'d0BHH, l\'e0m c
\'e3n c\u7913\'3f \'f0\u7875\'3f l\u7853\'3fp b\'e1o c\'e1o quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n v\u7873\'3f ngu\u7891\'3fn thu \'d0BHH.
\par \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c c\'f5 quan C\u7843\'3fng v\u7909\'3f, khi l\u7853\'3fp v\'e0 g\u7917\'3fi b\'e1o c\'e1o quy\u7871\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f39\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 t to\'e1n qu\'fd, n\'e3
