 thu c\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\'ed \'d0BHH ph\'f9 h\u7907\'3fp v\u7899\'3fi s\u7889\'3f li\u7879\'3fu \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 \'e3 }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 \'f0\u7889\'3fi chi\u7871\'3fu v\u7899\'3fi c\'f5 quan B\'d0ATHH Vi\u7879\'3ft nam .
\par b. Quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n chi:
\par Quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n chi c\u7911\'3fa c\'f5 quan B\'d0ATHH Vi\u7879\'3ft nam ph\u7843\'3fi ph\u7843\'3fn \'e1nh \'f0\u7847\'3fy \'f0\u7911\'3f c\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn chi th\'fd\u7901\'3fng xuy\'ean v\'e0 chi kh\'f4ng th\'fd\u7901\'3fng xuy\'ean theo t
\u7915\'3fng kho\u7843\'3fn m\u7909\'3fc quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa m\u7909\'3fc l\u7909\'3fc NSNN \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f s\u7921\'3f nghi\u7879\'3fp, so s\'e1nh v\u7899\'3fi k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch chi \'f0\'fd\u7907
\'3fc duy\u7879\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 t, ph\'e2n t\'edch t\'ecnh h\'ecnh th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12149932\charrsid9111383 \u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn c
