c giao.
\par 3/ C\'f5 quan B\'d0ATHH Vi\u7879\'3ft nam ; n\u7871\'3fu c\'f3 ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft kinh doanh d\u7883\'3fch v\u7909\'3f kh\'e1c tr\'ean c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f t\u7853\'3fn d\u7909\'3fng lao \'f0\u7897\'3fng nh\'e0n r\u7895
\'3fi, ph\u7843\'3fi t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n ri\'eang v\'e0 c\'f3 ngh\u297\'3fa v\u7909\'3f n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fy \'f0\u7911\'3f, b\'e1o c\'e1o quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n theo c\'e1c ch\u7881\'3f ti\'eau quy \'f0
